        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "          54 Guangh Jisu Guang Dat Zaic Pwni the",
            "                           9.9.12.9. Ref. 6. 8. 11.8.8",
            "          Doh hei G",
            "          1. Guangh Jisu guang dat zaic pwni the,",
            "             Lungning nthanmei guay ta laa khang.",
            "             Lauziu guay lev ziuh guay ta lou baihpui nungc kiu,",
            "             Rup-rian guay nang tabui daw ni cho?",
            "",
            "                        Heicpui tingmik nungc kiu,",
            "                        Zaatc guayna rui guang kariu ni.",
            "                        Nthanmei nunc Kapu pamv khou",
            "                        zaeng 'thaekc ni.",
            "                        Paapcmei guay ta latzan sw ni;",
            "                        Kanganv thay makna ryanraa ni.",
            "",
            "          2. Kamei muangh ruc khou key pwni the.",
            "             Meic kathuih rui Kata how pwni.",
            "             Kazak buy biwmei lev hian binmei nunc tei nic,",
            "             Lungh ryanraana Khrista ta how ni.",
            "",
            "          3. Rapchar ganv khou thow ding ngam ni cho?",
            "             Nang pumc tanhmei rui ding ngammak ge.",
            "             Pu-chaih thiu nking o, Bumaengh 'Thanmei lat tei.",
            "             Nang ta madanclou khang sw la tho.",
            "",
            "          4. Mi nungc kiu ch'rynmei tingmik sw 'ni.",
            "             Ch'rynmei ryanraa ryanriumei ruina,",
            "             Kanganv maekna bumaengh ryanraa ntamv nimei,",
            "             Kahym daihmei ta saa ngammak ge."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
